{
  "id": "u07",
  "section": 1,
  "order": 7,
  "title": "Requests & polite commands",
  "teTitle": "మర్యాద మాటలు",
  "cefr": "A2",
  "register": "standard",
  "description": "Ask for things politely, slow people down, and handle thanks and sorry the Telugu way.",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "u07-i01",
      "te": "కొంచెం నీళ్ళు ఇవ్వండి.",
      "gloss": "Please give me some water.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "కొంచెం", "gloss": "a little / please" },
        { "te": "నీళ్ళు", "gloss": "water" },
        { "te": "ఇవ్వండి", "gloss": "give (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["requests", "commands"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "note": "Telugu has no everyday word for 'please' — కొంచెం (konchem, 'a little') plus the polite -ండి ending does that job.",
      "distractors": ["u07-i09", "u07-i02"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i02",
      "te": "మళ్ళీ చెప్పండి.",
      "gloss": "Please say it again.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మళ్ళీ", "gloss": "again" },
        { "te": "చెప్పండి", "gloss": "say (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["requests", "learner"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "distractors": ["u07-i03", "u07-i04"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i03",
      "te": "కొంచెం నెమ్మదిగా చెప్పండి.",
      "gloss": "Please say it a little slowly.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "కొంచెం", "gloss": "a little" },
        { "te": "నెమ్మదిగా", "gloss": "slowly" },
        { "te": "చెప్పండి", "gloss": "say (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["requests", "learner"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "note": "Your superpower sentence as a learner — use it freely. నెమ్మదిగా (nemmadigaa) = slowly; మెల్లగా (mellagaa) works too."
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i04",
      "te": "ఇది చూడండి.",
      "gloss": "Look at this.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఇది", "gloss": "this" },
        { "te": "చూడండి", "gloss": "look (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["commands"],
      "difficulty": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i05",
      "te": "ఇక్కడికి రండి.",
      "gloss": "Please come here.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఇక్కడికి", "gloss": "to here" },
        { "te": "రండి", "gloss": "come (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["commands"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "distractors": ["u07-i07", "u07-i06"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i06",
      "te": "ఒక్క నిమిషం ఆగండి.",
      "gloss": "Please wait one minute.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఒక్క", "gloss": "just one" },
        { "te": "నిమిషం", "gloss": "minute" },
        { "te": "ఆగండి", "gloss": "wait / stop (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["requests", "commands"],
      "difficulty": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i07",
      "te": "లోపలికి రండి.",
      "gloss": "Please come inside.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "లోపలికి", "gloss": "to inside" },
        { "te": "రండి", "gloss": "come (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["commands", "hospitality"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "distractors": ["u07-i05", "u07-i08"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i08",
      "te": "తలుపు తీయండి.",
      "gloss": "Please open the door.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "తలుపు", "gloss": "door" },
        { "te": "తీయండి", "gloss": "open (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["commands"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "note": "Doors are 'taken' and 'thrown' in Telugu: తలుపు తీయండి = open the door, తలుపు వేయండి = close it!"
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i09",
      "te": "నాకు అది ఇవ్వండి.",
      "gloss": "Please give me that.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "నాకు", "gloss": "to me" },
        { "te": "అది", "gloss": "that" },
        { "te": "ఇవ్వండి", "gloss": "give (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["requests", "commands"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "distractors": ["u07-i01", "u07-i04"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i10",
      "te": "కొంచెం సాయం చేయండి.",
      "gloss": "Please help me a little.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "కొంచెం", "gloss": "a little / please" },
        { "te": "సాయం", "gloss": "help" },
        { "te": "చేయండి", "gloss": "do (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["requests"],
      "difficulty": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i11",
      "te": "అర్థం కాలేదు.",
      "gloss": "I didn't understand.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "అర్థం", "gloss": "meaning" },
        { "te": "కాలేదు", "gloss": "didn't happen" }
      ],
      "tags": ["learner"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "note": "Literally 'meaning didn't happen'. Say it without shame — it is every learner's best friend."
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i12",
      "te": "ధన్యవాదాలు!",
      "gloss": "Thank you!",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ధన్యవాదాలు", "gloss": "thanks (formal)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["politeness"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "note": "ధన్యవాదాలు (dhanyavaadaalu) is formal. Telugu families rarely say thanks out loud — gratitude lives in actions. With friends, a light థాంక్స్ works.",
      "distractors": ["u07-i13", "u07-i14"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i13",
      "te": "థాంక్స్ అన్నయ్యా!",
      "gloss": "Thanks, anna!",
      "words": [
        { "te": "థాంక్స్", "gloss": "thanks" },
        { "te": "అన్నయ్యా", "gloss": "elder brother (calling)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["politeness"],
      "difficulty": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i14",
      "te": "పర్వాలేదు.",
      "gloss": "It's okay / no problem.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "పర్వాలేదు", "gloss": "no problem" }
      ],
      "tags": ["politeness"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "distractors": ["u07-i12", "u07-i15"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i15",
      "te": "క్షమించండి, ఆలస్యం అయ్యింది.",
      "gloss": "Sorry, I got late.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "క్షమించండి", "gloss": "forgive (me) (polite)" },
        { "te": "ఆలస్యం", "gloss": "delay / lateness" },
        { "te": "అయ్యింది", "gloss": "it happened" }
      ],
      "tags": ["politeness"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "note": "క్షమించండి (kshaminchanDi) is the formal 'sorry'; among friends people just say సారీ."
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i16",
      "te": "కొంచెం అటు జరగండి.",
      "gloss": "Please move over a little.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "కొంచెం", "gloss": "a little" },
        { "te": "అటు", "gloss": "that way" },
        { "te": "జరగండి", "gloss": "move (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["requests", "commands"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u07-i06", "u07-i05"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i17",
      "te": "ఇది ఎలా చెప్పాలి?",
      "gloss": "How do I say this?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఇది", "gloss": "this" },
        { "te": "ఎలా", "gloss": "how" },
        { "te": "చెప్పాలి", "gloss": "should (one) say" }
      ],
      "tags": ["learner", "questions"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "note": "-ఆలి (-aali) = must/should: చెప్పాలి 'should say', వెళ్ళాలి 'must go'.",
      "distractors": ["u07-i02", "u07-i03"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u07-i18",
      "te": "నాకు తెలుగు నేర్పండి.",
      "gloss": "Please teach me Telugu.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "నాకు", "gloss": "to me" },
        { "te": "తెలుగు", "gloss": "Telugu" },
        { "te": "నేర్పండి", "gloss": "teach (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["requests", "learner"],
      "difficulty": 1
    }
  ],
